<title>USA: TABLE- Gibson Q2 shr $0.32 vs $0.36.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Gibson Q2 shr $0.32 vs $0.36.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
